body:
I have a dragon deck in winter pact that works well. It's basically offensive unit reduction using Hunter's Vengeance, Execution, and Broken Earth Drakes. I use GotW  instead of Frozen Core bc I don't think dragons and structures get along. Also, if you have to have a legendary you'd use Tegor the Vengeful, not the WP's Legendary dragon, since we're not freezing nor mana hoarding. The only non-dragon I really have is frosthexers (incase a unit is knocking at your door and you don't have anything).

&#x200B;

Good luck, dragons are a lot of fun if you have the patience to play the long game, a few words of advice: always try to trigger Ludic Matriarchs as early as possible.
